Package: kite-desktop
Version: 1.3.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfdesktop4, xfce4-settings, xfconf, thunar, xfce4-terminal,
 xfce4-power-manager, xfce4-power-manager-plugins, xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, xfce4-docklike-plugin,
 xfce4-notifyd, xfce4-screensaver, exo-utils, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin, xfce4-appfinder, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter, accountsservice, orchis-gtk-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, x11-xserver-utils, procps, python3, libspa-0.2-bluetooth, libxcb-shape0,
 gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, kite-system
Recommends: fonts-roboto | fonts-dejavu-core, brave-browser, onlyoffice-desktopeditors
Description: KiteOS desktop
 XFCE in a Windows-style layout set up by kite-layout: Fluent theme,
 Papirus-Light icons, a taskbar with the Start menu, search and apps on the
 left. The Search key opens the menu. Wallpapers, the LightDM login screen and
 lock screen (one look, set in Settings > Login Screen), KiteOS Task Manager
 and artwork.
